ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years for August to September and for October to November. In 2025 the middle ran 63% of normal in August to September and 47% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle sat at 45% in February to March and 162% in May to June. Grid 14860 had its driest year in 1952 at 60%.</p>"}
